# The development build standard (mold, the parallel frontend, Cranelift) and
# the pinned nightly are for development and CI. The images build for
# production on the stable MSRV compiler their `rust:` base image carries, so
# neither file may reach the build context; `COPY . .` would otherwise hand
# Cargo the nightly-only keys and rustup the nightly pin.
.cargo/
rust-toolchain.toml
